				id: "0E0FB90E78376E17"
				item: { Count: 32, id: "minecraft:iron_ingot" }
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Iron Age"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1000000000000004"]
			description: [
				"A furnace transforms, but slowly — one ingot at a time, burning fuel that took centuries to form."
				""
				"The old civilization found better ways. Their fragmented records speak of machines that crushed, ground, and refined with a speed no furnace could match."
				""
				"The knowledge is scattered, but the principles remain: apply force, apply heat, apply pressure. The method is yours to choose."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:blast_furnace"
			id: "1000000000000005"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3000000000000006"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 200
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Apply force. Apply heat. Apply pressure."
			tasks: [{
				count: 16L
				icon: "minecraft:iron_ingot"
				id: "2000000000000005"
				title: "Iron Dust (or Steel Ingots)"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Beyond the Furnace"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1000000000000005"]
			description: [
				"Muscle has limits. Fire has limits."
				""
				"But the forces of the world — wind, water, steam, pressure, heat differentials — those have no limits if you know how to harness them."
				""
				"You do not need to match the old civilization's scale yet. You only need to prove the principle: that energy can be captured, stored, and directed. Produce something that no hand alone could shape."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:redstone_block"
			id: "1000000000000006"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3000000000000007"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 200
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Energy captured, stored, directed."
			tasks: [{
