			title: "Steel Resolve"
			x: 1.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1000000000000007"]
			description: [
				"A single machine is a curiosity. A network is a civilization."
				""
				"Power must flow from source to consumer. Materials must move from extraction to processing. The old researchers understood this — their networks once spanned distances you cannot yet imagine."
				""
				"Yours does not need to span anything yet. But it must connect. Produce the components that bind machines together into something greater than the sum of their parts."
			]
