		{
			dependencies: ["1000000000000009"]
			description: [
				"A tool extends the hand. A machine extends the mind."
				""
				"When you build your first automated process, you cross a threshold the old civilization crossed millennia ago. The difference is that you know what lies at the end of this path. They did not."
				""
				"Produce something that requires more than a single machine — a chain of processes working together. The method does not matter. The principle does."
			]
