		{
			dependencies: ["1000000000000008"]
			description: [
				"What began as a shelter is becoming something else. Machines hum where silence once reigned. Materials flow through processes that did not exist yesterday."
				""
				"The space around you is no longer just a place to survive — it is a place to create."
				""
				"The old civilization would recognize this moment. It is the moment a workshop becomes a foundation. Prove that your workshop can produce more than one kind of output."
			]
