		{
			dependencies: [
				"1000000000000010"
				"1000000000000011"
			]
			description: [
				"In the process of rebuilding, you have stumbled upon something unexpected: understanding."
				""
				"Not just of how machines work, but of why. The principles behind rotation, pressure, heat, and chemistry are not inventions — they are discoveries. You are discovering them again, the same way the old researchers once did."
				""
				"But where they saw a single path forward, you see many. This is your advantage. Do not lose it."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:knowledge_book"
			id: "1000000000000012"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3000000000000014"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 500
