		{
			dependencies: [
				"1000000000000011"
				"1000000000000012"
			]
			description: [
				"From the fragments of forgotten knowledge, you have assembled something that hums with familiar energy."
				""
				"It is not a perfect replica of what once was — it is something new, built with your hands and your choices. The first relic of a civilization being understood again."
				""
				"&7&o[A damaged recording plays from a fragment of recovered technology. The voice is distorted, barely human, speaking a dialect that should not exist anymore.]&r"
				""
				"&f&o\"...the first stage is complete. Rotational fabrication confirmed. The principles hold.\"&r"
				""
				"&f&o\"But I must note for the record: we are building this wrong. There are other methods — pressure-based, chemical, atomic — and we are ignoring all of them because the Professor insists on a single path.\"&r"
				""
				"&f&o\"I hope we are right. I fear we are not...\"&r"
				""
				"&7&o[The recording dissolves into static. The Relic pulses once, then falls silent.]&r"
				""
				"The past has spoken. Now it is your turn to answer."
			]
